      ],
      "en": "I wish that you would bear with me in a little foolishness, but indeed you do bear with me.",
      "ko": "원컨대 너희는 나의 좀 어리석은 것을 용납하라 청컨대 나를 용납하라",
      "source_text_hash": "381d9c9c16d110b99de08dfe69f03b4f2a3c7d72cdfd19ff0b13a3a8cd568110",
      "translation_text_hash": "9244a3767ea7a1aa985b409c502aea17c76ce215e3815cd197c01a1fb5cc0fea",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "원컨대 너희는 나의 좀 어리석은 것을 용납하라 청컨대 나를 용납하라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9244a3767ea7a1aa985b409c502aea17c76ce215e3815cd197c01a1fb5cc0fea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2CO:11:2",
      "sequence": 28988,
