      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CO",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 20
        }
      ],
      "en": "For you bear with a man if he brings you into bondage, if he devours you, if he takes you captive, if he exalts himself, or if he strikes you on the face.",
      "ko": "누가 너희로 종을 삼거나 잡아 먹거나 사로잡거나 자고하다 하거나 뺨을 칠찌라도 너희가 용납하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "6b33dd850503d5d98aa847646800ef2f72cbb518ea1f4db80c599f6a869f6c35",
      "translation_text_hash": "44599fed609c7697200a4c899353326c980c933127f4338c47dcb6ebfa4d5c29",
