      "en": "To my shame, I speak as though we had been weak. Yet in whatever way anyone is bold (I speak in foolishness), I am bold also.",
      "ko": "우리가 약한 것 같이 내가 욕되게 말하노라 그러나 누가 무슨 일에 담대하면 어리석은 말이나마 나도 담대하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "2aa71245efec6541c77bd82cdef3e12a6422a79070fa413784a94dfbd0299e0d",
      "translation_text_hash": "0a3aadcf7ef613b85fce6de8e32b0aac68d9d11311fabcea2ba59233dad5ec7b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
